# Evidence Bundles Directory

Evidence bundles are stored here organized by date and slice ID.

Structure:
  evidence/
  └── [YYYY-MM-DD]/
      └── [SLICE-ID]/
          ├── before/
          │   └── baseline-status.log
          ├── after/
          │   ├── modified-files.txt
          │   ├── git-diff.patch
          │   ├── test-results.log
          │   └── build-results.log
          ├── verify.log
          └── Summary.md
